    "title": "AI for Real Estate Agents in Singapore, Hong Kong & Malaysia (2026)",
    "excerpt": "AI tools for Asian real estate agents: property listing generation, virtual staging, market analysis, and client matching. Compare OJO, PropertyGuru AI, Ohmyhome, and Zillow alternatives for Singapore, Hong Kong, and Malaysia markets.",
