    "slug": "best-ai-image-generators-compared-2026",
    "title": "Best AI Image Generators Compared 2026: Midjourney, DALL-E 3, Stable Diffusion, Firefly",
    "excerpt": "Midjourney vs DALL-E 3 vs Stable Diffusion vs Adobe Firefly vs Canva AI. Compare quality, pricing, and Asian representation in the best AI image generators of 2026.",
