    "title": "Best AI Tools for Freelance Designers in Asia 2026",
    "excerpt": "Compare Canva AI, Adobe Firefly, Midjourney, DALL-E 4, and Leonardo AI for graphic design, illustration, and branding. Find the best AI design tools with real pricing and output quality comparisons for Asian freelance designers.",
    "date": "2026-05-18",
